 /><zone xml:id="m-b4cc34a3-948e-4e42-ba30-7c666e3560ad" ulx="405" uly="785" lrx="504" lry="818" /><zone xml:id="m-3c65949c-41b9-4324-90a3-3083db9a3526" ulx="39" uly="816" lrx="888" lry="864" /><zone xml:id="m-64318d46-def3-496a-b76e-77b057a4fad5" ulx="27" uly="850" lrx="563" lry="886" /><zone xml:id="m-f1c37116-a676-471d-8fcf-37e66cdc1ea1" ulx="23" uly="876" lrx="460" lry="915" /><zone xml:id="m-e1383407-b69b-46d8-9b7e-8e012348244f" ulx="337" uly="922" lrx="575" lry="956" /><zone xml:id="m-bd038bc0-f672-4237-a056-9d340ab7adf6" ulx="31" uly="954" lrx="890" lry="992" /><zone xml:id="m-cd6a0e0c-a065-40fa-a4f0-90b9e97bbb7d" ulx="22" uly="985" lrx="847" lry="1025" /><zone xml:id="m-2693a953-3102-4c48-8282-fbd345a55aeb" ulx="260" uly="1081" lrx="630" lry="1126" /><zone xml:id="m-02cf216f-f8aa-4414-b540-c21e55c47492" ulx="793" uly="1087" lrx="890" lry="1128" /><zone xml:id="m-c51f61b6-5d54-42e0-a28a-c01c8443d71d" ulx="23" uly="1088" lrx="82" lry="1128" /><zone xml:id="m-b19eef18-1fc9-4140-b00c-eee79f449fb9" ulx="399" uly="1147" lrx="511" lry="1177" /><zone xml:id="m-962af1d3-cebb-4e7e-a8c9-eceebece5dc3" ulx="60" uly="1175" lrx="892" lry="1216" /><zone xml:id="m-64549fe0-3941-4b34-8e7e-e5ba90061426" ulx="22" uly="1208" lrx="890" lry="1246" /><zone xml:id="m-2039cc48-0320-45df-a914-add1a14c94fb" ulx="19" uly="1237" lrx="527" lry="1275" /><zone xml:id="m-5c181ede-a88c-43ce-b8c0-c031133ce074" ulx="45" uly="1272" lrx="738" lry="1309" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-4a0ade5b-ec99-4404-957b-8f120832197d" n="1823" facs="#m-15c3c627-ef5f-4ae3-8e6e-3780979fbda1" /><div xml:id="m-d1657842-2037-413e-8035-8afe5402a1f5">
            <lg xml:id="m-d100f41a-9ab6-4388-8ae1-1f3c4faa5cd5">
              <l xml:id="m-318be2a3-790b-4e39-beee-a906defc8bad" facs="#m-36bfabc6-875c-4392-bb43-fc1d5e886dfa" label="ambiguous">1599</l><l xml:id="m-9427c4d8-8206-4682-a146-72293f53a546" facs="#m-3f4fc4b6-1cf6-4083-89c2-d0297cb2ef19" label="ambiguous">August 12. 13. 14.</l><l xml:id="m-6944df5b-7268-46bc-a0fa-f8c5f190f096" facs="#m-31e55579-a481-48c7-8d17-ebe09a0aedd7" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-591a874e-7034-424f-9235-cf91f10dee3e" facs="#m-cac6cd5e-7f87-4311-bb28-158b42e97f54" label="lyrics-like">NUmpsimus Dómine pignus red- sanctis Martyribus tuis, vitae prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-e24f18be-c04b-41a2-a80b-f5117c64c30a" facs="#m-0b4a5258-d726-4f28-b8a3-3dd86897afd3" label="lyrics-like">O emptiónis aetérnae: quod sit séntis auxilium páriter et futürae.</l><l xml:id="m-37eadcfc-7452-4d86-9738-bcb3550d4fe1" facs="#m-d55ef574-b81e-42c3-87a0-9336b8acf257" label="lyrics-like">nobis, quaésumus, interveniéntibus ! Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-bd2f3cf5-e1fd-4741-a2a3-ecbca9c14dc0" facs="#m-9ae93dad-9be8-4984-9f4a-16151b06b6a6" label="ambiguous">St. Clare, Virgin.</l><l xml:id="m-09e48b0a-1391-4f09-80cb-a2278392b297" facs="#m-f6301324-85c4-49b1-b95f-2d5834b428ac" label="ambiguous">12.</l><l xml:id="m-8d8633d9-ef64-4805-9203-5c8877808dd1" facs="#m-4c1045d6-a2d5-4b3d-8111-9a2c7bb99ebe" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-21cd2cba-e893-4352-90ba-bc2052e2f146" facs="#m-8a673c67-6141-4a03-aba7-e022ebc59dd4" label="text-like">Mass. Dilexisti. p. 1225.</l><l xml:id="m-743ef999-eb44-48db-aada-0a82c24b9b18" facs="#m-87dec205-e318-4a51-89c5-600c9ee6f612" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e204d20b-a29e-4252-9f50-8b1731713871" facs="#m-adcbb3a3-74aa-4d90-a915-82fe1b31c9a3" label="lyrics-like">xáudi nos, Deus salutáris no-l mus; * ita piae devotiónis erudiá¬</l><l xml:id="m-aabc6967-08e7-4faf-9582-df335152c66a" facs="#m-6300573b-8023-46ba-8ffa-fa0ccd79b5f0" label="lyrics-like">C ster : tut sicut de beâtae Clarae] mur afféctu. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-bb93b6d7-9526-4c49-9cc6-8d5515182911" facs="#m-3feec4da-8a0c-4a07-977d-f04d1aff4cc3" label="lyrics-like">Virginis tuae festivitáte gaudé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f56e57e-fe57-4b76-ac65-2e848e839e18" facs="#m-c93b4b32-b2fa-4cd5-b5ed-adc5d5743fc2" label="text-like">SS. Hippolytus and Cassian, Martyrs. </l><l xml:id="m-bf812c8a-752d-48d3-a0a7-0833d83b4090" facs="#m-5cf1fc18-6aaf-415c-9d49-a2a8329646b5" label="ambiguous">13.</l><l xml:id="m-8d1013d0-eb12-4167-bf21-842b4085b77f" facs="#m-16b2e10d-0676-49fb-b7ed-ab92ad17564f" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-dd54f175-0214-4060-aea8-8712e8693491" facs="#m-ed74f0a2-e64d-454b-acde-21e93da7f197" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus omnípotens! veneránda solémnitas et devotió¬</l><l xml:id="m-f741eca9-7bd8-431f-a371-be03ace89628" facs="#m-19b40ed2-c054-469c-9efc-ea192b626d65" label="lyrics-like">1 Deus: * ut beatórum Márty-l nem nobis áugeat, et salútem. Per</l><l xml:id="m-f83e6052-9a5d-402c-aadf-1159d7fb7566" facs="#m-730f7767-b26b-4735-8ac9-3e29727acef0" label="lyrics-like">rum tuórum Hippólyti et Cassiáni! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2af91683-d18f-415f-b959-e69a63fb6731" facs="#m-b4cc34a3-948e-4e42-ba30-7c666e3560ad" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b9a92247-10cc-4589-b72a-9b5e655fc4c7" facs="#m-3c65949c-41b9-4324-90a3-3083db9a3526" label="lyrics-like">REspice Dómine múnera pópuli ] nobis proficiat ad salútem. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-016dfc33-c723-4359-9005-1157b1948eba" facs="#m-64318d46-def3-496a-b76e-77b057a4fad5" label="lyrics-like">1t tui, sanctórum festivitáte voti- minum.</l><l xml:id="m-ac0b5506-41bd-4caf-99c0-18423af61d62" facs="#m-f1c37116-a676-471d-8fcf-37e66cdc1ea1" label="lyrics-like">va: et tuae testificátio veritátis</l><l xml:id="m-11c0ddd1-424f-4e09-b2e1-2d5d27f6bdec" facs="#m-e1383407-b69b-46d8-9b7e-8e012348244f" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-d9398779-b50d-48c7-952d-5fd977864569" facs="#m-bd038bc0-f672-4237-a056-9d340ab7adf6" label="lyrics-like">CAcramentórum tuórum, Dómi-[ vet : et in tuae veritátis luce con¬</l><l xml:id="m-4985705f-cf0e-4cf6-bf70-7b7318a0c40e" facs="#m-cd6a0e0c-a065-40fa-a4f0-90b9e97bbb7d" label="lyrics-like">O ne, commúnio sumpta nos sal-l firmet. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-e957307d-da64-4ca9-8ca7-e4258bf12fb8" facs="#m-2693a953-3102-4c48-8282-fbd345a55aeb" label="ambiguous">St. Eusebius, Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-4195a8e6-e6cf-4630-ad5f-1edd55d06b41" facs="#m-02cf216f-f8aa-4414-b540-c21e55c47492" label="ambiguous">simple.</l><l xml:id="m-63882fb7-72f3-4011-a8f4-94545dbe32ce" facs="#m-c51f61b6-5d54-42e0-a28a-c01c8443d71d" label="ambiguous">14.</l><l xml:id="m-7495754b-6e07-4005-b287-619b5d043461" facs="#m-b19eef18-1fc9-4140-b00c-eee79f449fb9" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-0ce3229d-3372-43ba-adf9-3c0671d043f0" facs="#m-962af1d3-cebb-4e7e-a8c9-eceebece5dc3" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos beáti Eusébii Con-l cujus natalitia cólimus, per ejus ad</l><l xml:id="m-8384c07a-b71a-47eb-aabc-d7274c75b880" facs="#m-64549fe0-3941-4b34-8e7e-e5ba90061426" label="lyrics-like">U fessóris tui ánnua solemnitâte te exémpla gradiámur. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d9fadd9-443b-4d37-bf7a-d0ffccc343e5" facs="#m-2039cc48-0320-45df-a914-add1a14c94fb" label="lyrics-like">laetificas : * concéde propitius; ut! num.</l><l xml:id="m-34ef3d89-5703-46bb-985b-77f06c38aded" facs="#m-5c181ede-a88c-43ce-b8c0-c031133ce074" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Laudis tibi. and Postcommunion. Refécti cibo. p. 1203.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>